WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.100
The Senate Expense Scandal exposed an unelected, unaccountable system.

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:13.087
Appointed for life and paid over 160,000 dollars a year, senators billed taxpayers for personal expenses.

00:00:13.087 --> 00:00:17.675
The RCMP investigated, but zero convictions occurred.
